# GitHub & MCP — SDLC

## MCP (Cursor)

- Config: `.cursor/mcp.json` — server `github` (remote ou Docker)
- Token: env `GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN`
- Skill: `.sdlc/skills/github-sdlc/SKILL.md`

## Lifecycle

Plane task → **start_change** (branch from `develop`) → implement → **finish_change** (PR to `develop`) → Actions lint/test → human approval → merge

GitHub workflow cannot start without a Plane task identifier (`RPG-N`).

Workflows:
- `.sdlc/workflows/change-lifecycle.md` (toda alteração)
- `.sdlc/workflows/github-lifecycle.md`
- `.sdlc/workflows/lint-bug-resolution.md`

## Scripts

```bash
.sdlc/scripts/gh-branch-start.sh feature RPG-123
.sdlc/scripts/gh-branch-start.sh bugfix RPG-456
.sdlc/scripts/gh-issue-intent.sh "[Intent] …"
.sdlc/scripts/gh-pr-open.sh "feat: …" 12
.sdlc/scripts/gh-sdlc-status.sh
.sdlc/scripts/gh-labels-bootstrap.sh
```

## Labels SDLC

`sdlc:intent`, `sdlc:implement`, `sdlc:ready`, `sdlc:ci-fail`, `sdlc:lint-fail`, `sdlc:blocked`

## Segurança

- PAT nunca no repo
- Não force-push `main`
- Não criar branch fora de `feature/RPG-N` ou `bugfix/RPG-N`
- Não mergear sem aprovação humana explícita
